<title>GERMANY: Decision by July on supplementary budget -Kohl.</title>
<headline>Decision by July on supplementary budget -Kohl.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl said on Friday his government would decide by July whether it would issue a supplementary budget in view of the dramatic shortfall in tax revenues this year.</p>
<p>He affirmed the government's forecast that the economy would grow by 2.5 percent this year and said the labour market would improve by the end of the year.</p>
</text>
